---
const sponsors = [
  {
    tier: "Platinum",
    item: "受付中",
    sizeClass: "w-64 h-32 md:w-80 md:h-40 text-xl md:text-2xl rounded-md",
  },
  {
    tier: "Gold",
    item: "受付中",
    sizeClass: "w-48 h-24 md:w-64 md:h-32 text-lg md:text-xl rounded-md",
  },
  {
    tier: "Silver",
    item: "受付中",
    sizeClass: "w-36 h-16 md:w-48 md:h-24 text-base md:text-lg rounded-md",
  },
  {
    tier: "Bronze",
    item: "受付中",
    sizeClass: "w-28 h-12 md:w-36 md:h-16 text-sm md:text-base rounded-md",
  },
  {
    tier: "個人",
    item: "受付中",
    sizeClass: "w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24 text-xs md:text-sm rounded-full",
  },
];
---

<div class="mt-24">
  <h2 class="text-center lg:text-5xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight">スポンサー</h2>
  <div class="text-center mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      スクラム祭りでは、イベントの趣旨にご賛同いただき、ご協賛いただけるスポンサー様を募集しております。<br
      />
      詳細は開催趣意書をご確認の上、ご応募いただけますと幸いです。
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center">
      <a
        href="https://forms.gle/vkfXKwQEHvq1EQSf8"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors"
      >
        応募フォーム
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1vfSjbwu_ewGQsmBxNxXwoWoscmdaHQmKfNK0JXSPlXQ/edit?slide=id.g2f076a46b00_0_39#slide=id.g2f076a46b00_0_39"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium text-indigo-600 bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-colors"
      >
        開催趣意書
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-16 mt-16">
    {
      sponsors.map((sponsor) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-center font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-6">
            {sponsor.tier}
          </h3>
          <div class="flex gap-4 md:gap-6 items-center justify-center flex-wrap">
            <div class={`bg-slate-100 text-slate-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-slate-200 ${sponsor.sizeClass}`}>
              {sponsor.item}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</div>
